OL,3,GNEWSAWhy were turkeys taken on a       
OL,4,A3-month walk to London for Christmas?  
OL,6,FWhen the gobbling sounds of turkeys    
OL,7,Ffilled the air on the Suffolk/Essex    
OL,8,Fborder, residents would have been      
OL,9,Fforgiven for thinking there was a flock
OL,10,Fnearby.                                
OL,12,FHowever, it was actually a small group 
OL,13,Fof people dressed up as turkeys to mark
OL,14,Fthe long-lost practice of taking       
OL,15,Fturkeys on a three-month walk to London
OL,16,Ffor Christmas, and 500 years since the 
OL,17,Fbirds were introduced to the UK.       
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
