OL,3,GNEWSAWhy were turkeys taken on a       
OL,4,A3-month walk to London for Christmas?  
OL,6,FIt is many years since 90,000 turkeys  
OL,7,Fcrossed the bridge at Dedham. But the  
OL,8,Fgroup took a short walk across the     
OL,9,Fborder near the village on Wednesday to
OL,10,Fmark the anniversary after avian flu   
OL,11,Fprevented real birds being used for the
OL,12,Foccasion.                              
OL,14,FBut what exactly is turkey droving,    
OL,15,Fwhat is the history behind it and why  
OL,16,Fdid it take three months?              
